changes.source:
[img]gfx/ui/events/event_60.png[/img]{You spit and clear you throat, then you quickly clear your sword of its sheath and strike the caravan guard down. %randombrother% sees this and quickly barks out an order for the rest of the %companyname% to follow suit. There's a brief, confused carnage, the caravan guards unsure of what's going on as your men set upon them.

 Freeing the prisoner, he thanks you profusely then tells you to lead the way.%SPEECH_ON%Once we get to %noblesettlement%, and they see my lively and grinning face, you will be washed in crowns!%SPEECH_OFF% | You draw your sword and slash the guard across the face. He spins around and you crash the blade of your weapon through his brainpain, his organ frothing between slanted boneshards like a burst souffle. %randombrother% sees this and calls the rest of the company to combat. They make short work of the rest of the caravan guards. When you free %noble%, he points down the road.%SPEECH_ON%To %noblesettlement% where my family shall reward you like you cannot believe!%SPEECH_OFF% | As the caravan guard turns around, you take a dagger and jam it beneath his arm pit and directly into his heart. He muffles something, then falls to the ground. Another guard comes around, sees this, then sees your sword disembowel him. His cries, however, are not muffled. A battle soon commences, though it is completely lopsided as the %companyname% makes short work of the caravan guards.

 Once it is all said and done, %noble% is freed. Rubbing his purpled wrists, he points you toward %noblesettlement%.%SPEECH_ON%Onward, return me to my family so that I can fill your pockets for this incredible bravery!%SPEECH_OFF%}

changes.before:
[img]gfx/ui/events/event_60.png[/img]{你啐了一口，清清嗓子，随即拔剑，将商队护卫砍倒。%randombrother%见状，立刻大声命令%companyname%的其余人一同动手。杀戮短促而混乱，弟兄们已经扑到面前，商队护卫还没弄清发生了什么。

你解开囚犯的锁链。他千恩万谢，随即让你带路。%SPEECH_ON%只要到了%noblesettlement%，让他们看见我这张活蹦乱跳、笑容满面的脸，你就等着被克朗淹没吧！%SPEECH_OFF% | 你拔剑划过护卫的脸。他转过身，你又一剑劈开他的头颅，脑浆从斜插的碎骨之间涌出，像破裂的酥点。%randombrother%看见这一幕，立刻招呼其余弟兄投入战斗。他们很快解决了剩下的商队护卫。你放开%noble%时，他指向大路。%SPEECH_ON%去%noblesettlement%！我的家人会给你难以想象的重赏！%SPEECH_OFF% | 商队护卫刚转过身，你便把匕首从他腋下捅入，直刺心脏。他含混地哼了一声，倒在地上。另一个护卫绕过来，看见这一幕，紧接着便被你的长剑开膛破肚。他的惨叫可一点也不含糊。战斗很快打响，却完全一边倒，%companyname%轻易便杀光了商队护卫。

尘埃落定后，%noble%恢复了自由。他揉着青紫的手腕，指向%noblesettlement%。%SPEECH_ON%出发吧，送我回家！你们如此英勇，我一定要把你们的钱袋塞得满满的！%SPEECH_OFF%}

